# Coverage Reports

Generated by: make test, make ci

## Output Files

| File/Dir     | Description                                    |
|--------------|------------------------------------------------|
| html/        | HTML report (open html/index.html in browser)  |
| coverage.xml | XML report for CI integration                  |

## Configuration

File: pyproject.toml

| Section                | Purpose                           |
|------------------------|-----------------------------------|
| [tool.coverage.run]    | Source paths, branch coverage     |
| [tool.coverage.report] | Exclude patterns, show_missing    |
| [tool.coverage.html]   | HTML output directory             |
| [tool.coverage.xml]    | XML output path                   |
